 "slot_change_request": "IDX-SMALL 10-18, d4g plan (b): the v15 contract slot idx_sel (317.52x1164.24, 3.7:1, ~7.2k pins on a partial W face at 10.4/um) is superseded by the d4g grant slot idx_sel 600x450 (grants_d4g.json, FACES_ONLY, its E clock offset 581.3 lies outside a 450-um face). This kit takes 600x450 with W in_line+control+observes, E clock (SE end)+selected_line, S out_line (<= 5.8 pins/um); H-D4G places the xq root node W and the link E. (g4p: same slot/faces as g4; pipelined core.)",
 "job": {
  "owner": "Claude HBM-IDXPIPE 1018",
  "branch": "claude/hbm-idxselp-1018",
  "tag": "g4p",
  "purpose": "HBM-IDXPIPE 10-18: FALLBACK of hidx_sel_g4 (55 logic levels) = the pipelined selector core 98f4b19a7 (SRAM read registered; compare+tie prefix, tie-budget mask, one-hot prefix pack, barrel merge, registered write; histogram H1/H2/H3; reset via ot_rst_relay, datapath unreset) on the g4 one-root shell (clk_ctl clocks every flop and all 12 SRAMs). Same d4g slot 600x450, macro placement, faces and pins as hidx_sel_g4. Calendar (tools/hbm_idx_static_calendar.py): sel_core_out +2 (link fields +2), sel_scan_drain +2 per scan pass; with the pipelined link (--link-pipe 5) the IDX frame is 1397 -> 1408 edges. Benches run_selector.sh SHELL=1 on the die master: MUT0 pass / MUT1 (ties) / MUT2 (emitted ID) fail.",
  "extra_paths": [
   "tools/hbm_idx_static_selector_vectors.py",
   "rtl/test/hbm_idx_static",
   "physical/asap7_memory_macros_v2/ot_sram_1r1w_256x256_m2_r2c2",
